{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Unwrap unrecoverable execution errors too**\n\n`DurableExecutor` also supplies `UnrecoverableDurableExecutionException` for nondeterminism, illegal operations, and durable API failures. This branch only unwraps `DurableOperationException`, so those records lose `ErrorObject.errorType`\u2014including service error codes\u2014and report the generic wrapper class. Extract the `ErrorObject` from both wrapper types through a shared helper and add terminal and retrying error tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7nh9ce","finding_digest":"3bfa1162f4c84faa9a002e6621b8c7176715627ab46319d2ea4e572cd76285ab","finding_id":"arf_v1_hp5bcyxuzbh2vgqafztcdoghc5","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::toerrorinfo::unrecoverable-error-object-preservation","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::toerrorinfo::unrecoverable-error-object-preservation","line":348,"observation_digest":"59f67e620ec414df1384892f8d0dfbbd39dd3382a01770332c7c42e362a2308b","observation_id":"aro_v1_lh3h4yqoyqkn6e4erexy2dp3xu","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/WorkflowInsight.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-08-28T22:27:07Z","review_id":"arr_v1_5xididmhluq4mhdhugntjpm257","reviewed_base_sha":"6501c39f553655583e33238eb1d821e4f44b8e26","reviewed_head_sha":"bdbd88fcdf777f50567d968c0e73fa11c8eb39ad","reviewer":"codex","start_line":348,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_54ai67c5ekswjemgswejoflvga","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-08-28T22:27:07Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
